    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74136" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνομ-αστί</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>by name,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. τινὰς βώσαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.79
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακαλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.70
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διελθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					9.51
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνησθῆναί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.58
				</span></i>
			.—Rare in Poets, as <i><span class="en">
				Critias
				6.3
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.Oxy.</u>
				2080.81
			</span></i>:—in form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνῠμαστί</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Berl.Sitzb.</u>
				1927.167
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyrene</span>). [Written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ί</span> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.57.44
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(v B.C.)</span>, <u>Berl.Sitzb.</u>l.c., and this is
			confirmed by the quantity <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Critias
			</span></i> and Call.ll.cc.; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					355.18
				</span></i>
			 (Ilium, iv/ <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				218.27
			</span></i> (ibid., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>).]</div>
